     {
      "he": "גְּשָׁמִים",
      "en": "rain"
     },
     {
      "he": "בִּתְחִיַּת",
      "en": "in the revival of",
      "note": "The second bracha of Shemoneh Esrei, \"Mechayei Hameisim.\""
