    "en": "and we ask for rain in the bracha for a good year,",
    "words": [
     {
      "he": "וְשׁוֹאֲלִין",
      "en": "and we ask for"
     },
     {
      "he": "הַגְּשָׁמִים",
      "en": "the rain"
     },
     {
      "he": "בְּבִרְכַּת",
      "en": "in the bracha of"
