      "he": "בְּחוֹנֵן",
      "en": "in \"Who grants\"",
      "note": "The bracha \"Atah Chonen,\" asking for wisdom."
     },
     {
      "he": "הַדָּעַת.",
      "en": "knowledge"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "רַבִּי עֲקִיבָא אוֹמֵר,",
    "en": "Rabbi Akiva says,",
    "words": [
