      "he": "רַבִּי",
      "en": "Rabbi"
     },
     {
      "he": "עֲקִיבָא",
      "en": "Akiva",
      "note": "A great Rabbi of the Mishnah."
     },
     {
      "he": "אוֹמֵר,",
      "en": "says"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "he": "אוֹמְרָהּ בְּרָכָה רְבִיעִית בִּפְנֵי עַצְמָהּ.",
    "en": "we say it as a fourth bracha all by itself.",
    "words": [
